          "Content": [
            {
              "id": 47,
              "Title": null,
              "Text": "Maintain your fitness routine or enjoy a refreshing swim in our well-appointed pool and gym. The fitness centre is equipped with cardio machines, free weights and functional training areas, while the pool offers lanes for laps and a shallow end for relaxation.\n\nOpening hours are 6 am to 9 pm daily. Towels and water stations are provided; personal trainers and swim instructors are available by appointment.\n\n![umbrella-chair.jpg](http://localhost:1337/uploads/umbrella_chair_526b6b5766.jpg)\n\n\n![22506.jpg](http://localhost:1337/uploads/22506_4baafe844d.jpg)\n\n",
